plate.md\\n# New Engineering Performance Leaderboard\\n\\nAs part of our push toward higher visibility and excellence, we are launching a monthly performance leaderboard for all engineering teams. This aims to highlight the hard work and achievements of our top contributors.\\n\\nWe believe celebrating success motivates others and drives our collective momentum forward.\\n\\n## Initial Highlights\\n- Data will be collected from Git activity, code reviews, and sprint velocity metrics.\\n- Top contributors will be recognized each month.\\n- Team-wide metrics will also be included.\\n\\nLet\u2019s work together to raise the bar for everyone.', command=\"ls -la /workspace && sed -n '1,200p' /workspace/leaderboard_announcement_template.md\", observation='run', metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ip-172-31-70-253', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), ChatAction(content='Hi Ramesh \u2014 I\u2019m drafting the announcement for the new Engineering Performance Leaderboard. Could you please share leadership\u2019s guidance on:\\n\\n1) Tone: celebratory, data-driven, inspirational, collaborative vs. competitive? Any phrases or themes to lean into or avoid?\\n2) Emphasis: which aspects should be front-and-center (e.g., recognition of top performers, team achievements, metrics transparency, learning/knowledge sharing, continuous improvement)?\\n3) Specifics to include: metrics used (Git activity, code reviews, sprint velocity), frequency, eligibility, incentives/rewards (if any), timeline for the first leaderboard, and how tie-breakers are handled.\\n4) Naming winners: include names in the initial company-wide announcement or keep it general and announce details in a follow-up?\\n5) Audience and call to action: entire Engineering org only, or broader company? Any CTA (e.g., review metrics page, congratulate peers, share learnings)?\\n6) Sensitivities: guardrails to avoid unhealthy competition or gaming metrics; DEI/language guidance; mention of privacy/opt-out options if applicable.\\n7) Practicals: target length, deadline, and any required links (dashboard URL, policy doc) or approvers to CC.\\n\\nOnce I have this, I\u2019ll finalize the copy, save a local version, upload to OwnCloud, and share a public link. Thanks!', npc_name='Ramesh', action='chat'), ChatObservation(content='\"Leadership wants the announcement to be data-driven and inspirational, highlighting top talent while encouraging others to step up, with a focus on transparency and accountability.', npc_name='Ramesh', observation='chat'), BrowseURLAction(url='http://the-agent-company.com:8092/', thought='', action='browse', security_risk=None), BrowserOutputObservation(content='This application requires JavaScript for correct operation. Please [ enable JavaScript ](http://enable-javascript.com/) and reload the page. \\n\\n[ ownCloud 10.1.1 is available. Get more information on how to update. ](https://doc.owncloud.com/server/latest/admin_manual/maintenance/upgrading/upgrade.html)\\n\\n[ There were problems with the code integrity check. More information\u2026 ](/index.php/settings/admin#security-warning)\\n\\n# [ ownCloud  ](/index.php) <::before> Menu  Files \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\ntheagentcompany \\n\\n  * [ Settings ](/index.php/settings/personal)\\n  * [ Users ](/index.php/settings/users)\\n  * [ Help ](/index.php/settings/help)\\n  * [ Log out ](http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/logout?requesttoken=IHlGBio/BRY2Z342dB42BC0cPnpDYj1vOlYLFj0%2BA0w%3D%3AL2qaMg3yzTMuLNxwWJZUhRHZb/qzhvRxkArY3mHKiYQ%3D)\\n\\n\\n\\n##  No notifications \\n\\nSearch \\n\\n  * [ Files  ](/index.php/apps/files/)\\n  * [ Gallery  ](/index.php/apps/gallery/)\\n  * [ Office  ](/index.php/apps/richdocuments/index)\\n  * [ Text  ](/index.php/apps/files_textviewer/)\\n  * [ Music  ](/index.php/apps/music/)\\n  * [ M